<div data-route-fallback-page="about"{% if template.name == '404' %} hidden{% endif %}>
<section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-hero-title">
  <div class="about-hero-copy">
    <div>
      <h1 id="about-hero-title">{{ 'about.hero_title' | t }}</h1>
      <p>{{ 'about.hero_copy' | t }}</p>
      <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/shop-all">{{ 'about.shop_now' | t }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="about-hero-image">
    <img src="{{ 'about-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="An active woman standing confidently on a beach" width="1200" height="800">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-story" aria-labelledby="about-story-title">
  <div class="about-story-inner">
    <span class="about-kicker">Liposomal</span>
    <h2 id="about-story-title">{{ 'about.story_title' | t }}</h2>
    <p>{{ 'about.story_1' | t }}</p>
    <p>{{ 'about.story_2' | t }}</p>
    <p>{{ 'about.story_3' | t }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-faqs" aria-labelledby="about-faq-title">
  <div class="about-faq-heading">
    <span class="about-kicker">FAQs</span>
    <h2 id="about-faq-title">{{ 'product.faq_title' | t }}</h2>
    <span class="about-faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↳</span>
    <button type="button" data-toggle-all-faqs>{{ 'about.view_all' | t }}</button>
  </div>
  <div class="about-faq-list" data-about-faqs>
    {% assign questions = "How long does it take to see results from dietary supplements?|Are there potential side effects of dietary supplements?|How does Cata-Kor ensure the quality of its ingredients?|Are your products gluten-free?|Are your products non-GMO/organic?|Are your products safe to take with medications?|Do you have samples?" | split: "|" %}
    {% assign answers = "The time to experience results varies based on the supplement and individual factors. Consistency in usage is key. Some may notice changes quickly, while others may require more time.|While most people tolerate supplements well, side effects can occur. Report any adverse reactions to a healthcare provider.|We source ingredients carefully and use rigorous testing and industry-leading quality standards.|Yes.|Yes.|Please consult a certified healthcare professional before use if you take medication or have a known medical condition.|Not at this time." | split: "|" %}
    {% if request.locale.iso_code == 'es' %}
      {% assign questions = "¿Cuánto se tarda en notar los resultados de los suplementos?|¿Los suplementos pueden producir efectos secundarios?|¿Cómo garantiza Cata-Kor la calidad de sus ingredientes?|¿Los productos contienen gluten?|¿Los productos son no transgénicos u orgánicos?|¿Puedo tomar los productos con medicamentos?|¿Tenéis muestras?" | split: "|" %}
      {% assign answers = "El tiempo necesario para notar resultados depende del suplemento y de cada persona. La constancia es fundamental: algunas personas notan cambios pronto y otras necesitan más tiempo.|Aunque la mayoría de las personas tolera bien los suplementos, pueden producirse efectos secundarios. Informa a un profesional sanitario si notas una reacción adversa.|Seleccionamos cuidadosamente los ingredientes y aplicamos análisis rigurosos y estándares de calidad líderes en el sector.|Sí.|Sí.|Consulta con un profesional sanitario acreditado antes de usarlos si tomas medicamentos o tienes alguna afección médica conocida.|Por el momento, no." | split: "|" %}
    {% endif %}
    {% for question in questions %}
      <details>
        <summary><span>{{ forloop.index | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 }}.</span><b>{{ question }}</b><i aria-hidden="true">⌄</i></summary>
        <p>{{ answers[forloop.index0] }}</p>
      </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{"name":"Exact About page","settings":[]}
{% endschema %}
